# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 7 (`$k` steps on the click, in the click's tick), ch. 8 (`<-` binds the plain result), ch. 9 (a host re-emits each forwarded place of its child under its own place, keyed by the child's path) and ruling TC (places counted as built): the `if` above the host builds its label at 1, so the host is 2 (1 when it builds nothing); the child's places are numbered from 0 as in sem-ch09-host-late-value-above-from-arm-lines. Never run before this commit.
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1: Ui.Label(text="before")
    2/[0]/0: Ui.Label(text="ten")
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="wide 1")
    2/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="loud 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="loud 1")

test soft

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1: Ui.Label(text="before")
    2/[0]/0: Ui.Label(text="wide 2")

test loud_nothing_before

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1/[0]/0: Ui.Label(text="ten")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="wide 1")
    1/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="loud 0")
